WEBVTT

00:09:29.356 --> 00:09:32.509
not on flags 100 feet away
flapping in the breeze.

00:09:32.533 --> 00:09:34.404
So here's a bunch of flags again.

00:09:34.428 --> 00:09:37.616
Vexillologists call these SOBs:

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:39.058
Seals on a bedsheet --

00:09:39.082 --> 00:09:40.254
(Laughter)

00:09:40.278 --> 00:09:43.156
and if you can't tell
what city they go to,

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.047
yeah, that's exactly the problem,

00:09:45.071 --> 00:09:48.019
except for Anaheim,
apparently, they fixed it.

00:09:48.043 --> 00:09:50.144
(Laughter)

00:09:51.208 --> 00:09:53.541
These flags are everywhere in the US.

00:09:53.565 --> 00:09:55.734
The European equivalent
of the municipal seal

00:09:55.758 --> 00:09:57.504
is the city coat of arms ...

00:09:58.368 --> 00:10:01.549
and this is where we can learn
a lesson for how to do things right.